Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativescenehost
Name: DuoFace Native Dashboard Scene Host (Development)
Version: 0.1.3~scenehostqa1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate
Description: First-party independent Native12 split visual scene and bounded UIKit control windows: two top-center slot pills, 28/30-point divider logo, ratio pan (one-third to two-thirds with snapping), 0.30-second logo reposition, App/Zoom/Style/Close picker, per-slot focus/restore, swap and vertical/horizontal split. Rootless CarPlay, keeps Apple Dock and session-bound input relay. No vendor code, licenses or iPhone app scene hosting yet.
